* A legacy monolith must be migrated incrementally without disrupting existing customers. How would you apply the strangler pattern?
* A downstream service returns HTTP 429 during heavy traffic. How would you design backpressure and rate-limit handling?
* A multi-region deployment experiences temporary network partitioning. How would you handle availability and consistency trade-offs?
* One tenant consumes most of the shared platform resources. How would you isolate tenants and enforce quotas?
